# Release provenance files needed for the new sources.
!teachmechat/LICENSE
!teachmechat/NOTICE.md
!teachmechat/CONTRIBUTING.md
!teachmechat/SECURITY.md
!teachmechat/CHANGELOG.md
!teachmechat/PUBLISHING.md

# Personal one-off scripts: keep their real names in .git/info/exclude (local,
# never committed) instead of this shared file, so no contact or account name
# is ever published. See teachmechat/PUBLISHING.md step a).
